note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note om/golden/ollm/drive.om: the DRA-52 golden-token gate drivers (Core #853, PR #926). Replaces the
note former build.sh, record.sh, gate.sh, core-gate.sh and check.sh; every sequencing step and every
note judgment of the drivers is made here, the comparisons themselves stay in gate.om.
note Build (from the repository root): OMC=<omc bf54b19f> bash om/golden/build.sh OUT om/golden/ollm/drive.om
note Run from the repository root (repo files are read relative to it). Modes:
note   drive build OMC TRAIN REV OUT [NEGCTL]
note     fetches the aien-train clone TRAIN's HEAD, heads, tags and remotes (never refs/replace)
note     into a private bare repository OUT/src.git made without templates, resolves REV there to
note     one commit and snapshots it with git archive from there, so TRAIN's working tree, index
note     flags, untracked files, replace refs, info/grafts, info/attributes and config never reach
note     the build; every git child runs as /usr/bin/env GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1
note     GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null GIT_ATTR_NOSYSTEM=1 git --no-replace-objects. The commit's own
note     .gitattributes (export-ignore, export-subst) is part of the commit and applies. Builds
note     it with the snapshot's own tests/omegallm/build.sh (TARGET=gb10, OMC pinned omega-mv
note     e5b32567), appends gdec.om, optionally applies one NEGCTL (.neg) perturbation, compiles
note     OUT/ollm-golden. Prints BUILD_OK sha path source_sha256 sha commit sha.
note   drive record TRAIN REV CK MERGES PROMPTS OUT [LABEL]       (env OMC_TRAIN, OMC_GATE)
note   drive gate TRAIN REV REF CK MERGES PROMPTS OUT             (env OMC_TRAIN, OMC_GATE, hold)
note     resolves REV once (as build does) to a commit id, pins OUT/src.git HEAD to it; candidate and
note     negctl build that id from OUT/src.git, and each build's commit must equal it (else BROKEN)
note   drive core                     (tests/gates/run.sh gb10-golden-tokens; env AIEN_*)
note   drive check                    (host arms; env OMC_GATE, optional OMC_TRAIN and TRAIN)
note Child programs run through execprog with an empty environment; every child path is absolute.
note Exit: build 0 ok, 1 build failure, 3 compiler not pinned, 4 composition refused, 2 usage;
note gate 0 PASS, 1 FAIL, 3 NOT_RUN, 4 BROKEN; core 0 PASS, 1 FAIL or BROKEN, 77 NOT_RUN.

