note review finding 1 (27da864e local read): TRAIN's info/grafts and info/attributes must not select
note the commit or shape the snapshot. U = an empty commit on the tamper T; HEAD~1 is T (the b5 source),
note and the graft U -> HEAD~2 would make HEAD~1 name the clean commit instead
