else
cfailm tatbad
end
end

note review finding 2 (27da864e local read): the gate resolves REV once. Fixture: branch gmove at a
note commit whose build.sh first moves gmove one commit back, so every build moves the branch
fn chk8 to void
sayt 1 th8
ctmp SX ttg
agit
apt tclone
apt tq0
apt tnohl
aps STRN
aps SX
pat tnl0
arm tclonea 0
agit
apt tdash
aps SX
apt tco
apt tq0
apt tdb
apt tgmv
arm tgfx1 0
sjoin SP SX tbsh
ok = fload SP
if not ok
cfailm tfixbad
ret
end
sset SV tmvl1
ss SV SX
sx SV tmvl2
fd = fopf SP 577
